:''Not to be confused with [[Kaworu & Cat (Special Cat)]].''
'''Kaworu Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Neon Genesis Evangelion Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 10.2 Update|Version 10.2]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 552
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Kaworu Cat
|name2 = Moon Kaworu Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Moon Kaworu Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
This unit lacks the stats to be very viable, especially for a unit with single target, so its use is not recommended outside of the early game. Its Evolved Form trades attack rate for range, so, depending by the situation, either form can perform better.

Do not use against non-Darks.

{{Job|Classification = Midranger}}

